@startuml US09 - Task Management API Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
    BorderColor #1E88E5
}
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #8E24AA
}

title US09 - Task Management API Architecture

package "Client Layer" {
    [Logistics Operator Web App] as WebApp
    [Mobile App] as MobileApp
    [External Systems] as External
}

package "API Gateway" {
    [API Gateway] as Gateway
    [Authentication Service] as Auth
    [Rate Limiting] as RateLimit
}

package "Task Management API" {
    [Task Controller] as TaskController
    [Resource Allocation Controller] as ResourceController
    [Schedule Controller] as ScheduleController
    [Task Service] as TaskService
    [Resource Allocation Service] as ResourceService
    [Schedule Service] as ScheduleService
}

package "Domain Layer" {
    [Task Aggregate] as TaskAggregate
    [Resource Allocation Aggregate] as ResourceAggregate
    [Task Schedule Aggregate] as ScheduleAggregate
    [Domain Events] as DomainEvents
}

package "Infrastructure Layer" {
    [Task Repository] as TaskRepo
    [Resource Repository] as ResourceRepo
    [Schedule Repository] as ScheduleRepo
    [Event Store] as EventStore
    [Message Queue] as MessageQueue
}

package "External Services" {
    [Resource Management System] as ResourceSystem
    [Vessel Visit System] as VesselSystem
    [Notification Service] as NotificationService
    [Audit Service] as AuditService
}

' Client connections
WebApp --> Gateway
MobileApp --> Gateway
External --> Gateway

' API Gateway connections
Gateway --> Auth
Gateway --> RateLimit
Gateway --> TaskController
Gateway --> ResourceController
Gateway --> ScheduleController

' Controller to Service connections
TaskController --> TaskService
ResourceController --> ResourceService
ScheduleController --> ScheduleService

' Service to Domain connections
TaskService --> TaskAggregate
ResourceService --> ResourceAggregate
ScheduleService --> ScheduleAggregate

' Domain connections
TaskAggregate --> DomainEvents
ResourceAggregate --> DomainEvents
ScheduleAggregate --> DomainEvents

' Service to Repository connections
TaskService --> TaskRepo
ResourceService --> ResourceRepo
ScheduleService --> ScheduleRepo

' Repository to Infrastructure connections
TaskRepo --> EventStore
ResourceRepo --> EventStore
ScheduleRepo --> EventStore

' External service connections
TaskService --> ResourceSystem
TaskService --> VesselSystem
TaskService --> NotificationService
TaskService --> AuditService

' Event handling
DomainEvents --> MessageQueue
MessageQueue --> NotificationService
MessageQueue --> AuditService

note right of TaskController
    **Task Management Endpoints:**
    - GET /api/tasks
    - POST /api/tasks
    - PUT /api/tasks/{id}
    - DELETE /api/tasks/{id}
    - POST /api/tasks/{id}/start
    - POST /api/tasks/{id}/complete
    - POST /api/tasks/{id}/fail
end note

note right of ResourceController
    **Resource Allocation Endpoints:**
    - GET /api/resource-allocations
    - POST /api/resource-allocations
    - PUT /api/resource-allocations/{id}
    - DELETE /api/resource-allocations/{id}
    - POST /api/resource-allocations/optimize
end note

note right of ScheduleController
    **Schedule Management Endpoints:**
    - GET /api/schedules
    - POST /api/schedules
    - PUT /api/schedules/{id}
    - POST /api/schedules/{id}/optimize
    - GET /api/schedules/vessel-visit/{visitId}
end note

note bottom of TaskAggregate
    **Core Business Logic:**
    - Task creation and validation
    - Dependency management
    - Status transitions
    - Resource requirements
    - Duration calculations
end note

note bottom of ResourceAggregate
    **Resource Management:**
    - Resource allocation
    - Conflict detection
    - Availability checking
    - Qualification matching
end note

note bottom of ScheduleAggregate
    **Schedule Optimization:**
    - Task sequencing
    - Resource optimization
    - Constraint satisfaction
    - Parallel execution planning
end note

@enduml
